\description{
Tools for processing British Columbia's Vegetation Resources Inventory (VRI) data and generating forest yield curves. The package provides functions to subset VRI data, match polygons to existing managed stand yield curves, identify records requiring VDYP7 processing, and execute the complete VDYP7 workflow including parameter file creation, execution, and post-processing of results.

